{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-8","kind":"proposition","title":"正五边形对角线中的黄金分割","englishTitle":"If in an equilateral and equiangular pentagon straight lines subtend two angles taken in order, they cut one another in extreme and mean ratio, and their greater segments are equal to the side of the pentagon.","book":13,"number":8,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.8","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.8/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":8,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","contentId":"euclid-13-8","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb768d36ada1f463c168c0a4420b3a21943c6335236f52c92a3f8d7836e6f41f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-8.statement","euclid-13-8.proof.1","euclid-13-8.construction.1","euclid-13-8.proof.2","euclid-13-8.proof.3","euclid-13-8.proof.4","euclid-13-8.proof.5","euclid-13-8.proof.6","euclid-13-8.proof.7","euclid-13-8.proof.8","euclid-13-8.proof.9","euclid-13-8.proof.10","euclid-13-8.conclusion","euclid-13-8.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-8.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"992ccb904ffb9446f3da57f0e594b15465ddc948baf7041bed336c4bd200400a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If in an equilateral and equiangular pentagon straight lines subtend two angles taken in order, they cut one another in extreme and mean ratio, and their greater segments are equal to the side of the pentagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在等边和等角五角形直线中,将两个角度相向,黄金分割它们相互切开,其较大的部分等于五角形的一侧。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"775022a0fcdaf0e7c591a87447902a4db6f4ede9ae443d76a917c62fcfaf7ff8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For in the equilateral and equiangular pentagon ABCDE let the straight lines AC, BE, cutting one another at the point H, subtend two angles taken in order, the angles at A, B; I say that each of them has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at the point H, and their greater segments are equal to the side of the pentagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等边形和角形ABCDE,让直线AC,BE在H点相互切开,分解两个角度,角度为A,B;我说,每个角度在H点的黄金分割分被切开,较大的部分等于五角形的一侧。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e081273569354a7148f85b9edaa4d00a8740145fa3ff5ef54b5bcfabf0bf0072","citations":["euclid-4-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the circle ABCDE be circumscribed about the pentagon ABCDE. [[IV. 14](/principles/euclid-4-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"作经过五边形 ABCDE 各顶点的外接圆 ABCDE。 [[IV. 14](/principles/euclid-4-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f25269fd4b9a1815f2ea8fd5864b8064c3bee23a082d5f56bae9f9c4a666b187","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the two straight lines EA, AB are equal to the two AB, BC, and they contain equal angles, therefore the base BE is equal to the base AC, the triangle ABE is equal to the triangle ABC, and the remaining angles will be equal to the remaining angles respectively, namely those which the equal sides subtend. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于两条直线EA,AB等于两条AB,BC, 并含有相等角度,因此底边,BE等于底边,AC,三角形ABE等于三角形ABC,其余角度将分别等于其余角度,即两侧所向下角。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b6f2d40fb204c04db8a32be44f8f2a3152d9d47587a0ebc0f3e31cac59df7f4d","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle BAC is equal to the angle ABE; therefore the angle AHE is double of the angle BAH. [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BAC角等于ABE角;因此,AHE角是BAH角的两倍。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"02812eb2fdb853bf5025bd5b30257df4ebcd1da7c45517f73f802058e78125da","citations":["euclid-3-28","euclid-6-33","euclid-1-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle EAC is also double of the angle BAC, inasmuch as the circumference EDC is also double of the circumference CB; [[III. 28](/principles/euclid-3-28), [VI. 33](/principles/euclid-6-33)] therefore the angle HAE is equal to the angle AHE; hence the straight line HE is also equal to EA, that is, to AB. [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EAC角也是BAC角的两倍,因为EDC角也是CB角的两倍,因此HAE角等于AHE角,因此,HE线也等于EA,即AB。 [ [III. 28](/principles/euclid-3-28) [VI. 33](/principles/euclid-6-33) [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1edf684fd0ecea3944f2ff669ce96b0e74ff72c964b946c71dff84413a3804bc","citations":["euclid-1-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the straight line BA is equal to AE, the angle ABE is also equal to the angle AEB. [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于直线BA等于AE,角度ABE也等于角度AEB。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a433f0c3b39259285614f62b1a10bbbc64273e63851c3157eafe4ffec47b3ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle ABE was proved equal to the angle BAH; therefore the angle BEA is also equal to the angle BAH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ABE角被证明等于BAH角,因此BEA角也等于BAH角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4cf63d493a8a6f46bdc13f6dfad7a9a6cfee0c6a2fc011155155357643804942","citations":["euclid-1-32","euclid-6-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the angle ABE is common to the two triangles ABE and ABH; therefore the remaining angle BAE is equal to the remaining angle AHB; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the triangle ABE is equiangular with the triangle ABH; therefore, proportionally, as EB is to BA, so is AB to BH. [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"角度ABE是两个三角形的常见点,即ABE和ABH;因此,剩余角度BAE等于其余角度AHB;因此,三角形ABE是同三角形ABH的等角;因此,比例而言,EB对BA的比等于AB对BH的比；EB 与 BA 之比等于 AB 与 BH 之比。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"48c8f0de7d4c4b8a4a2c54d4ae39c3a98586d5355baeb15776b57341201feb67","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BA is equal to EH; therefore, as BE is to EH, so is EH to HB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BA等于EH;因此,BE对EH的比等于EH对HB的比；BE 与 EH 之比等于 EH 与 HB 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d95cf3ec9f83e78802d1167437e2ea279b9f6978a5729d1cc5dff8f5958ac0f8","citations":["euclid-5-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And BE is greater than EH; therefore EH is also greater than HB. [[V. 14](/principles/euclid-5-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BE比EH强,EH也大于HB。 [[V. 14](/principles/euclid-5-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ab2cb8dcb6122b282bd1c84dd20c22872e47023497e0b8bedfacad6d84140de","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BE has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at H, and the greater segment HE is equal to the side of the pentagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,黄金分割削减了BE,为H,较大的数量部分HE相当于五角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67a4acb3d0df340f509ee31397bc64c66571b150245e51c1ec16f986de77983e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that AC has also been cut in extreme and mean ratio at H, and its greater segment CH is equal to the side of the pentagon. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,黄金分割的AC的H也被削减,其CH段与五角形的Q段相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-8.source","contentId":"euclid-13-8","revisionId":"euclid-13-8@raw-bb768d36ada1f463","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4156f45b83d2543c25a523d2a49f8fa1c41c9a9e6ce31f127125421e630472e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.8/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.8\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-8:euclid-4-14: